iki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_AbandonedCistern_ReallyGozz</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_AbandonedCistern_ReallyGozz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_AbandonedCistern_ReallyGozz\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">b3a3022c-485f-4e96-9f03-ba8a401082d4</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b3a3022c-485f-4e96-9f03-ba8a401082d4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b3a3022c-485f-4e96-9f03-ba8a401082d4\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Vutt\" title=\"Vutt\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Doppelganger.png/25px-Portrait_Doppelganger.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Doppelganger.png/38px-Portrait_Doppelganger.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Doppelganger.png/50px-Portrait_Doppelganger.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Vutt\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Portrait_Doppelganger.png/25px-Portrait_Doppelganger.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Portrait_Doppelganger.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Vutt\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Vutt\">Vutt</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Minsc\" title=\"Minsc\">Stone Lord's</a> hideout in the <a href=\"/wiki/Abandoned_Cistern\" title=\"Abandoned Cistern\">Abandoned Cistern</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>-Second Draft-\n</p><p><br>\nAll the Faceless know that you earned <a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\">Orin's</a> approval, Gozz, and managing the <a href=\"/wiki/Minsc\" title=\"Minsc\">mad Rashemi</a> is an important assignment, but you're letting this whole '<a href=\"/wiki/Jaheira\" title=\"Jaheira\">Jaheira</a>' impersonation go to your knobbly head. You don't even drop out of it when the Stone Lord is asleep! Moreover, simulated boss or no, you don't have to be openly disrespectful when ordering the rest of us around. Your <a href=\"/wiki/Harper\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Harper\">Harper</a> gig won't last forever, and then you'll be one of the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Greater_doppelganger\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shallar\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Greater_doppelganger\">Shallar</a></span> again. We'd rather be your friends.\n</p><p><br>\n- Vutt\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714214404\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.060 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.063 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2302/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 36102/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10745/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 972124/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   50.229      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   50.229      1 -total\n 66.12%   33.212     10 Template:Icon_text\n 58.51%   29.389     23 Template:Trim\n 29.96%   15.049      1 Template:PageSeo\n 29.81%   14.973      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 29.72%   14.930      5 Template:Icon_link\n 27.97%   14.047      3 Template:CharLink\n 20.63%   10.361      2 Template:Uid\n 19.92%   10.005     10 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:46435-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714214404 and revision id 365789. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}